  "description": "White over a dark navy belly, the two parted by a gold band that starts under the nose, sweeps up and thins to a fine line along the lower side, and a second gold line edging the belly that widens aft and sweeps up into the fin's lower trailing corner. The navy fin, woven all over with a fine gold basket-weave, runs down onto the body in a sweep ahead of the fin's root, edged in gold, with a white band between it and the gold corner. Two slanted white bars and a small white four-point star near the fin's top. 'STARLUX' in wide navy capitals over the forward windows; the A350-1000s add a big woven '1000' behind the wing. Dark engines.",
